{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>譚詠麟《刻骨銘心世界巡迴演唱會》Part 2情不變篇，今晚（22/9）舉行尾場，去到尾段，譚詠麟正準備唱由李克勤及劉德華填詞的新歌《我在意》時，見到二人在台下，即興地叫二人上台。「你哋有聽過嘛，識唔識唱㗱？一係，你哋上嚟個台，我兜口兜面唱畀你聽，唔識唱就企喺度等我唱畀你聽。」</p><p>三位在台上締造經典畫面，合唱新歌，而劉德華更在台上，表示代表歌迷，當眾向譚詠麟說：「求下你，繼續唱落去。」此刻李克勤笑言：「唔係講下咩？」</p><p>最後三人難捨難離，在譚詠麟提議下合唱《朋友》，更承諾華仔12月演唱會時，會嘉賓合唱由譚詠麟作曲的《下雨晚上》。</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260923/1179219343678902272645078.jpeg/15M3CJJX8MXW_O6DHXh7c59TCi7E76yjR4k7f32JO38\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260923/1179219355322814464650923.jpeg/LBZtPFJgWs768YGTHxAI6dtD8KeDj5ihoKYdb5qmHW8\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260923/1179219352655106048619470.jpeg/Wwlft1KgDd85JXEjx1KKz8g9ooHvvF14LdYZOBfWGTg\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260923/1179219349773488128095317.jpeg/N6GvqPWORcy-KRsnKOSahcMlEgAl6dkyPrulOgS7pTo\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260923/1179219346870898688579624.jpeg/s15IzidJYmk5xZGnZwpb3IoYpRMacop03Zc7n-eXO58\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260923/1179219344027029504627813.jpeg/Wqm96-0yZ2EI_ltCdGPWKmqXuQ1wanUXOlUVBgBVFQY\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-22T18:58:55.027938+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":264,"images":6,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}